  "notes": "Modified cash basis city (governmental funds modified cash, enterprise funds accrual); basis set to cash. beginning/ending cash are the governmental fund balances rolled forward on p4 (1,241,890 -> 1,121,147; ending equals cash 918,845 + CDs 192,360 + county treasurer 9,942 on p3). Governmental lines from Total Governmental Funds column p4; transfers net +200 in total column (GF +5,283, Street +344,308, Sales Tax -344,308, CDBG -5,083), business-type -200 (Water and Sewer). Business-type from proprietary statement p6 Total column; no single total printed, so totals are operating + nonoperating. Proprietary cash flow statement (p7) shows only the Electric Fund column in the trim; proprietary null (not GAAP). Balance sheet: government-wide Statement of Net Position p1 (includes governmental capital assets), component unit excluded. General Fund detail from the departmental combining schedule p12 (more detailed than the p8 budget schedule, which is not recorded). Proprietary statement lines are not added to detail because some funds have their own schedules (user 2026-10-28). Read pages 1-12 of 12."
